message PIRATE_THEFT
OUT FROM THE SHADOWS BEHIND YOU POUNCES A BEARDED PIRATE!\n
"HAR, HAR," HE CHORTLES, "I'LL JUST TAKE ALL THIS BOOTY AND\n
HIDE IT AWAY WITH ME CHEST DEEP IN THE MAZE!"\n
HE SNATCHES YOUR TREASURE AND VANISHES INTO THE GLOOM.
@
message PIRATE_RUSTLE
THERE ARE FAINT RUSTLING NOISES FROM THE DARKNESS BEHIND YOU.
@
message PIRATE_TALLY_REVEAL
THERE ARE FAINT RUSTLING NOISES FROM THE DARKNESS BEHIND YOU.\n
AS YOU TURN TOWARD THEM, THE BEAM OF YOUR LAMP FALLS ACROSS A BEARDED PIRATE.\n
HE IS CARRYING A LARGE CHEST.\n
"SHIVER ME TIMBERS!" HE CRIES,\n
"I'VE BEEN SPOTTED!  I'D BEST HIE MESELF OFF TO THE MAZE TO HIDE ME CHEST!"\n
WITH THAT, HE VANISHES INTO THE GLOOM.
@
message HERE_CHEST
THE PIRATE'S TREASURE CHEST IS HERE!
@
message INV_CHEST
TREASURE CHEST.
@
message HERE_MESSAG
