message REPOSITORY_NE_LONG
YOU ARE AT THE NORTHEAST END OF AN IMMENSE ROOM, EVEN LARGER THAN\n
THE GIANT ROOM.\n
IT APPEARS TO BE A REPOSITORY FOR THE "ADVENTURE" PROGRAM.\n
MASSIVE TORCHES FAR OVERHEAD BATHE THE ROOM WITH SMOKY YELLOW LIGHT.\n
SCATTERED ABOUT YOU CAN BE SEEN A PILE OF BOTTLES (ALL OF THEM EMPTY)\n
A NURSERY OF YOUNG BEANSTALKS MURMURING QUIETLY, A BED OF OYSTERS, A BUNDLE\n
OF BLACK RODS WITH RUSTY STARS ON THEIR ENDS, AND A COLLECTION OF BRASS\n
LANTERNS.\n
OFF TO ONE SIDE A GREAT MANY DWARVES ARE SLEEPING ON THE FLOOR,\n
SNORING LOUDLY.\n
A SIGN NEARBY READS: "DO NOT DISTURB THE DWARVES!"\n
AN IMMENSE MIRROR IS HANGING AGAINST ONE WALL, AND STRETCHES TO THE OTHER\n
END OF THE ROOM, WHERE VARIOUS OTHER SUNDRY OBJECTS CAN BE GLIMPSED DIMLY\n
IN THE DISTANCE.
@
message REPOSITORY_NE_SHORT
YOU'RE AT NE END.
@
message REPOSITORY_SW_LONG
YOU ARE AT THE SOUTHWEST END OF THE REPOSITORY.\n
TO ONE SIDE IS A PIT FULL OF FIERCE GREEN SNAKES.\n
ON THE OTHER SIDE IS A ROW OF SMALL WICKER CAGES,\n
EACH OF WHICH CONTAINS A LITTLE SULKING BIRD.\n
IN ONE CORNER IS A BUNDLE OF BLACK RODS WITH RUSTY MARKS ON THEIR ENDS.\n
A LARGE NUMBER OF VELVET PILLOWS ARE SCATTERED ABOUT ON THE FLOOR.\n
A VAST MIRROR STRETCHES OFF TO THE NORTHEAST.\n
AT YOUR FEET IS A LARGE STEEL GRATE, NEXT TO WHICH IS A SIGN WHICH READS,\n
"TREASURE VAULT. KEYS IN MAIN OFFICE."
@
message REPOSITORY_SW_SHORT
YOU'RE AT SW END.
@
message CLOSED_TRANSPORT
THE SEPULCHRAL VOICE ENTONES, "THE CAVE IS NOW CLOSED."\n
AS THE ECHOES FADE, THERE IS A BLINDING FLASH OF LIGHT\n
(AND A SMALL PUFF OF ORANGE SMOKE). . . .\n
AS YOUR EYES REFOCUS, YOU LOOK AROUND AND FIND...
@
message BLAST_SUCCESS
THERE IS A LOUD EXPLOSION, AND A TWENTY-FOOT HOLE APPEARS IN THE FAR\n
WALL, BURYING THE DWARVES IN THE RUBBLE.\n
YOU MARCH THROUGH THE HOLE AND FIND YOURSELF IN THE MAIN OFFICE,\n
WHERE A CHEERING BAND OF FRIENDLY ELVES CARRY THE CONQUERING ADVENTURER\n
OFF INTO THE SUNSET.
@
message BLAST_LAVA
THERE IS A LOUD EXPLOSION, AND A TWENTY-FOOT HOLE APPEARS IN THE FAR\n
WALL, BURYING THE SNAKES IN THE RUBBLE.\n
A RIVER OF MOLTEN LAVA POURS IN THROUGH THE HOLE, DESTROYING EVERYTHING\n
IN ITS PATH, INCLUDING YOU!
@
message BLAST_SPLASHED
THERE IS A LOUD EXPLOSION, AND YOU ARE SUDDENLY SPLASHED ACROSS THE\n
WALLS OF THE ROOM.
@
message DWARVES_AWAKENED
THE RESULTING RUCKUS HAS AWAKENED THE DWARVES.\n
THERE ARE NOW SEVERAL THREATENING LITTLE DWARVES IN THE ROOM WITH YOU!\n
MOST OF THEM THROW KNIVES AT YOU!\n
ALL OF THEM GET YOU!
@
