HE FIXES YOU WITH A STEELY GLARE AND DECLARES,\n
"THIS ADVENTURE HAS LASTED TOO LONG." \n
WITH THAT HE MAKES A SINGLE PASS OVER YOU WITH HIS HANDS,\n
AND EVERYTHING AROUND YOU FADES AWAY INTO A GREY NOTHINGNESS.
